  <section class="section">
    <div class="container article-body">
      <h1>Contact Us</h1>
<p>Have a question, noticed a regional price update, or want to suggest an improvement? We value feedback from our community of DQ fans.</p>

    <h2>What We Can Help With</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Reporting outdated or regional menu price variations</li>
      <li>Notifying us of seasonal Blizzard flavor releases or test items</li>
      <li>Corrections to calorie, portion sizing, or nutrition information</li>
      <li>General feedback and collaboration inquiries</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>What We Cannot Help With</h2>
    <p>We are an independent reference guide and not affiliated with Dairy Queen®. We cannot assist with: customer service complaints at specific store locations, gift card balances, DQ mobile app technical bugs, franchise inquiries, or job applications. For those inquiries, please contact <a href="https://www.dairyqueen.com/en-us/contact/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Dairy Queen official customer care directly</a>.</p>
    <h2>Email</h2>
    <p>Reach our editorial team at: <strong><a href="mailto:hello@thequeendairymenu.us">hello@thequeendairymenu.us</a></strong></p>
    <p>We review messages daily and aim to reply within 1–2 business days.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
